# package-lock.json is the only lockfile: the publish workflow installs it
# with npm. Make dependency changes with npm, so that package-lock.json
# changes with package.json. Where there's no bun.lock, bun seeds one from
# package-lock.json, then keeps using its own, so after package-lock.json
# changes, delete bun.lock before installing with bun.
bun.lock
bun.lockb
